93368496209,"status":"ok","value":[{"title":"Coming Full Circle, With a Little Detour","synopsis":"At the festival, Granny is running a fortune telling stand. She sees Mikael walking past and invites him in. We discover that Granny knows who Mikael is (or at least knows he's been encouraging Noelle's endeavor to become an angel) and tells him to leave Noelle alone. Yuusuke and child-Natsumi are on their way to the festival to make their wish. Miruru is confronted by Dispel, who has come to capture Noelle himself. He tries to kill Miruru but Gabriel steps in and saves her. He realizes that he's not itchy and theorizes that since he drank Miruru's blood (a few episodes ago) he's immune to his cat allergy now. The comet is over head and Noelle is preparing to run like her and Lucca had been practicing, when Dispel drops in and throws Lucca through the clock tower before chasing after Noelle who tried to run away. Yuusuke and Natsumi had been on their way to the top of the clock tower to make their wish when Lucca came crashing through. Yuusuke's friends and their teacher see Dispel going after Noelle and throw their durian's at him to try and slow him down. Noelle and Dispel end up at the top of the clock tower. Yuusuke tries to help but gets blown off the building. He's trying to hold on to both the building and Natsumi while Disple tries to kick him off. Yuusuke and Natumi fall and Noelle jumps after them. There's a flash of light, Noelle's halo flashing and expanding, and her mechanical wings take flight, enabling her to save Yuusuke and Natusmi, all three of them safely landing on the ground. Disple, believing that he failed in preventing Noelle from becoming an angel, leaves. Natsumi, who had a vision of her brother telling her to let him go and move on, has turned back into her normal self to Yuusuke's relief. Back at the lair, Dispel is upset and Silky, his supposed slave, tells him Noelle isn't an angel yet and says she's bored now. She was apparently in charge the whole time, Dispel just being a doll. Back at the school, Mikael is trying to figure out what","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859081.jpg"},{"title":"Because Promises are in the Heart","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859091.jpg"},{"title":"Something That`s Too Far to Reach","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859101.jpg"},{"title":"Feelings That Cannot Be Answered","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859111.jpg"},{"title":"Untying and Tying","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859121.jpg"},{"title":"Having Both is Bad?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859131.jpg"},{"title":"Power of Love","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859141.jpg"},{"title":"Close Dream, Far Person","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859151.jpg"},{"title":"There Are Untrue Truths","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859161.jpg"},{"title":"Just Stretch Your Hand and... See?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859181.jpg"},{"title":"A Breaking Heart","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859191.jpg"},{"title":"That Which is Waiting on the Other Side of the Door","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859201.jpg"},{"title":"Because I Want Everything, I Need Nothing","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859231.jpg"},{"title":"What Is Truly Important Right Now","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/103571/859251.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
